// `[Inline]` is honoured on PilIR and `--emit c` (selfhost/ir/pass_inline.pilot)
// but not yet on the seed engine (PROP-007 step 4), so the checker reports
// warning[INLINE001] once, at the marked declaration, and the program still
// runs the same on every engine: twice(21) = 21 * 2 = 42.
[Inline]
fn twice(x: i64) -> i64 => x * 2;

fn main() {
    print(twice(21));
}
